#!/bin/bash
# P5f driver, local only (no cluster): functional gate-level simulation, zero delay, cell models generated by
# Yosys from the NanGate45 liberty file. No SDF, no timing. NanGate45, not TSMC. No RTL change.
# Netlists: synthesis/p5f/regen_netlists.sh (P5e flow, rtl-v2-final) -> results/P5f_gls/netlists/ (not committed).
# Steps:
#   models     yosys read_liberty -ignore_miss_func; write_verilog -> results/P5f_gls/models/ (not committed)
#   cellcheck  tools/p5f_cellcheck.py on every cell type the netlists use, plus NAND2/AOI21/OAI21/MUX2 and the
#              unused DFFRS_X1 (async clear + preset)                                  -> results/P5f_gls/CELLCHECK.md
#   coverage   tools/p5f_coverage.py: distinct cell types, model coverage, scan flops -> results/P5f_gls/COVERAGE.md
#   sim        unmodified rtl/v2/tb_lfu_cache.sv on each netlist via tools/p5f_wrap.py -> results/P5f_gls/sim/
#   lockstep   synthesis/p5f/tb_gls_lockstep.sv, RTL vs netlist, 200,000 cycles      -> results/P5f_gls/lockstep/
#   equiv      Yosys equiv_make/equiv_simple/equiv_induct, RTL vs netlist, depth 16   -> results/P5f_gls/equiv/
# Each simulation and each equivalence run is capped at 2 h (timeout 7200; exit 124 = timed out).
#   bash synthesis/p5f/run_p5f.sh [models|cellcheck|coverage|sim|lockstep|equiv]...   default: all
set -uo pipefail
ROOT=$(cd "$(dirname "$0")/../.." && pwd)
R=$ROOT/results/P5f_gls; N=$R/netlists; M=$R/models/nangate45_cells_yosys.v
LIB=${LIB:-$HOME/eda/pdk/nangate45/NangateOpenCellLibrary_typical.lib}
STEPS=${*:-"models cellcheck coverage sim lockstep equiv"}
JOBS=${JOBS:-6}
RUNS=$(for d in 256 64 16; do for m in 0 1; do for f in 1000 500; do echo "d${d}_m${m}_${f}MHz"; done; done; done)
export ROOT R N M
# one simulation: kind (sim|lockstep) run-name; compile and run times are measured separately
sim1() {
    kind=$1 run=$2; d=${run#d}; d=${d%%_*}; m=${run#*_m}; m=${m%%_*}
    w=$R/work/$kind/$run; o=$R/$kind/$run.txt; mkdir -p "$w" "$R/$kind"
    python3 -I "$ROOT/tools/p5f_wrap.py" "$N/$run/netlist.v" "$d" "$m" "$w" || { echo "wrap failed" > "$o"; return; }
    if [ "$kind" = sim ]; then
        src=("$M" "$w/netlist_gl.v" "$w/wrapper.v" "$ROOT/rtl/v2/tb_lfu_cache.sv")
        par=(-Ptb_lfu_cache.COUNTER_MODE=$m -Ptb_lfu_cache.CACHE_DEPTH=$d)
    else
        src=("$M" "$w/netlist_gl.v" "$ROOT/rtl/v2/lfu_cache_controller.v" "$ROOT/synthesis/p5f/tb_gls_lockstep.sv")
        par=(-Ptb_gls_lockstep.COUNTER_MODE=$m -Ptb_gls_lockstep.CACHE_DEPTH=$d)
    fi
    { echo "# $kind $run: functional gate-level simulation, zero delay, cell models generated by Yosys from the liberty file"
      t0=$(date +%s.%N)
      iverilog -g2012 "${par[@]}" -o "$w/$kind.vvp" "${src[@]}" > "$w/iverilog.txt" 2>&1; rc=$?
      t1=$(date +%s.%N)
      echo "iverilog exit=$rc compile_s=$(echo "$t1 - $t0" | bc)"
      grep -v "timescale" "$w/iverilog.txt" | sort | uniq -c | head -n 20
      if [ $rc = 0 ]; then
          (cd "$w" && timeout 7200 vvp -n "$kind.vvp") > "$w/vvp.txt" 2>&1; rc=$?
          t2=$(date +%s.%N)
          echo "vvp exit=$rc (124 = 2 h limit hit) run_s=$(echo "$t2 - $t1" | bc)"
          grep -v '^\$finish\|finish called\|^VCD' "$w/vvp.txt" | tail -n 40
      fi; } > "$o" 2>&1
    gzip -f "$w"/*.txt 2>/dev/null
}
export -f sim1
for step in $STEPS; do case $step in
models)
    mkdir -p "$R/models"
    yosys -l "$R/models/yosys.log" -p "read_liberty -ignore_miss_func $LIB; write_verilog -noattr $M" > /dev/null
    grep -i "ignoring" "$R/models/yosys.log" > "$R/models_ignored.txt"
    (cd "$R" && sha256sum models/nangate45_cells_yosys.v > models.sha256; sha256sum "$LIB" | sed "s|$HOME|~|" >> models.sha256) ;;
cellcheck)
    used=$(cat "$N"/d*/netlist.v | grep -oE '^\s+[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*_X[0-9]+ ' | sort -u | tr -d ' ')
    python3 -I "$ROOT/tools/p5f_cellcheck.py" "$LIB" "$M" "$R/work/cellcheck" \
        $(printf '%s\n' NAND2_X1 AOI21_X1 OAI21_X1 MUX2_X1 $used DFFRS_X1 | awk '!s[$0]++') > "$R/CELLCHECK.md" ;;
coverage)
    python3 -I "$ROOT/tools/p5f_coverage.py" "$M" "$R/CELLCHECK.md" "$N"/d*/netlist.v > "$R/COVERAGE.md"
    echo "coverage exit=$?" ;;
sim|lockstep)
    echo "$RUNS" | xargs -P "$JOBS" -I{} bash -c "sim1 $step {}" ;;
equiv)
    mkdir -p "$R/equiv"; W=$R/work/equiv; mkdir -p "$W"
    sed 's/^module lfu_cache_controller /module gold /' "$ROOT/rtl/v2/lfu_cache_controller.v" > "$W/gold.v"
    for run in d16_m0_1000MHz d16_m1_1000MHz d16_m0_500MHz d16_m1_500MHz; do
        m=${run#d16_m}; m=${m%%_*}
        sed 's/^module lfu_cache_controller(/module gate(/' "$N/$run/netlist.v" > "$W/gate_$run.v"
        ( t0=$(date +%s)
          timeout 7200 yosys -q -p "read_verilog -sv $W/gold.v; read_verilog $M $W/gate_$run.v; chparam -set CACHE_DEPTH 16 -set COUNTER_MODE $m gold; hierarchy -check; proc; opt_clean; memory; flatten; async2sync; equiv_make gold gate eq; hierarchy -top eq; equiv_simple; equiv_induct; equiv_status -assert" > "$R/equiv/$run.txt" 2>&1
          echo "depth=16 run=$run exit=$? (0 = all proven, 124 = 2 h limit hit) wall_s=$(( $(date +%s) - t0 ))" >> "$R/equiv/$run.txt" ) &
    done
    wait
    gzip -f "$W"/*.v ;;
*) echo "unknown step $step"; exit 2 ;;
esac; done
